---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Chaparral Disposal Service LLC | Trash Collection & Dumpster Rentals in Chaparral, NM"}
  description={"Family owned & locally operated for 33 years. Reliable residential trash collection, commercial dumpster rentals, and disposal services across Chaparral, NM and the surrounding valley."}
  canonical="https://chaparraldsllc.com/"
  cacheStrategy="static"
>
<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__grid">
    <div class="reveal in">
      <span class="eyebrow">★ Family owned & operated for 33 years</span>
      <h1>Reliable waste collection for the whole Chaparral valley.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Residential trash pickup, commercial dumpster rentals, and dependable disposal services — done on time, every time, by a local team you can trust.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/services">View Services</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__trust">
        <div><b>33+</b><small>Years serving the valley</small></div>
        <div><b>10+</b><small>Communities covered</small></div>
        <div><b>100%</b><small>Locally owned</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-people">
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.4 8.5 8 10 4.6-1.5 8-5 8-10V6l-8-4z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <small>Trusted by <b style="display:inline;">families &amp; businesses</b> across the valley</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__card reveal in">
      <h3>Why neighbors choose Chaparral Disposal</h3>
      <ul class="quote-list">
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Prompt, on-schedule pickups</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Flexible dumpster rental options</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Affordable, transparent pricing</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Friendly, responsive local team</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact" style="margin-top:22px;width:100%;justify-content:center;">Start Service Today</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SERVICES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we do</span>
      <h2>Complete waste & disposal services</h2>
      <p>From weekly curbside pickup to roll-off dumpsters for your next big project — we keep Chaparral clean.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18l-1.5 14a2 2 0 0 1-2 1.8H6.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-1.8L3 6z"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Residential Trash Collection</h3>
        <p>Dependable weekly curbside pickup for your home. Set your cans out and we handle the rest — reliably, every route day.</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 8h16l4 5v4h-3M2 8v9h3M6 8V5h9v3"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Commercial Dumpster Rentals</h3>
        <p>Front-load and roll-off dumpsters sized for businesses, job sites, and property managers. Scheduled service that scales with you.</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </article>
      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0 9 9 0 0 0-18 0z"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Disposal & Junk Removal</h3>
        <p>Cleaning out, renovating, or moving? We haul away bulky waste and debris so you can get the job done without the hassle.</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services">Learn more <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FEATURE SPLIT ============ -->
<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The local difference</span>
      <h2>Big-company service, small-town care.</h2>
      <p>For over three decades, the Gaytan family has kept Chaparral and the surrounding communities clean. We know these neighborhoods because we live here too — and it shows in every pickup.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Prompt pickups you can set your clock by</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Straightforward, affordable pricing — no surprises</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Real people answering the phone when you call</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Flexible options for homes and businesses alike</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/about" style="margin-top:26px;">Our Story</a>
    </div>
    <div class="media-frame reveal">
      <!-- PLACEHOLDER PHOTO: swap for a real photo of your trucks / a local neighborhood you serve -->
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Local neighborhood we serve">
      <div class="badge"><b>Locally owned & operated</b><small>Serving Chaparral, NM since 1992</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STATS ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats reveal">
      <div class="grid grid-4">
        <div class="stat"><b>33+</b><small>Years in business</small></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>10+</b><small>Towns served</small></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>1,000s</b><small>Pickups completed</small></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>5★</b><small>Local reputation</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS ============ -->
<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Getting started is easy</span>
      <h2>Service in three simple steps</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3 steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><h3>Request a quote</h3><p>Call us or fill out the quick contact form and tell us what you need — home pickup or a dumpster.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><h3>Pick your schedule</h3><p>We'll set you up with the right service and a pickup schedule that fits your home or business.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><h3>We handle the rest</h3><p>Set it out on route day and we take care of the haul-away — on time, every time.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SERVICE AREA ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Proudly local</span>
      <h2>Where we serve</h2>
      <p>Reliable, affordable waste collection across Chaparral and the surrounding New Mexico communities.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="map-wrap reveal">
      <figure class="map-state" aria-label="Map of New Mexico with the Chaparral service area highlighted in the south near El Paso">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 512 572" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path class="nm-fill" d="M30.4,30.0 L481.2,30.0 L481.2,480.0 L211.3,480.0 L218.0,499.5 L92.8,499.5 L92.8,540.0 L30.4,540.0 Z"/>
          <circle class="nm-glow" cx="214.3" cy="475.5" r="30"/>
          <circle class="nm-ring" cx="214.3" cy="475.5" r="16"/>
          <circle class="nm-dot"  cx="214.3" cy="475.5" r="6"/>
          <text class="nm-tag" x="190.3" y="447.5" text-anchor="end">Our service area</text>
          <text class="nm-name" x="230" y="150" text-anchor="middle">NEW MEXICO</text>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>Southern New Mexico &middot; Doña Ana County</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="map-detail" aria-label="Detailed map showing the nine communities served">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 380 420" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect class="detail-bg" x="6" y="6" width="368" height="408" rx="16"/>
          <polyline class="rio" points="55.0,72.8 62.9,60.6 94.7,103.1 75.3,139.6 126.5,185.7 144.1,253.7 90.3,333.9"/>
          <text class="rio-label" x="61.3" y="139.6" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 61.3 139.6)">Rio Grande</text>
      <g class="pin pin--hq">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="311.8" cy="208.8" r="7"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="311.8" cy="208.8" r="7"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="298.8" y="212.8" text-anchor="end">Chaparral (HQ)</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="55.0" cy="72.8" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="55.0" cy="72.8" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="66.0" y="86.8" text-anchor="start">San Miguel</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="62.9" cy="60.6" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="62.9" cy="60.6" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="73.9" y="57.6" text-anchor="start">Mesquite</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="55.9" cy="116.5" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="55.9" cy="116.5" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="66.9" y="120.5" text-anchor="start">La Mesa</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="94.7" cy="103.1" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="94.7" cy="103.1" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="105.7" y="100.1" text-anchor="start">Vado</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="75.3" cy="139.6" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="75.3" cy="139.6" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="86.3" y="144.6" text-anchor="start">Chamberino</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="126.5" cy="185.7" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="126.5" cy="185.7" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="137.5" y="189.7" text-anchor="start">Berino</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="144.1" cy="253.7" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="144.1" cy="253.7" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="155.1" y="257.7" text-anchor="start">Anthony</text>
      </g>
      <g class="pin">
        <circle class="pin__pulse" cx="90.3" cy="333.9" r="5"/>
        <circle class="pin__dot" cx="90.3" cy="333.9" r="5"/>
        <text class="pin__label" x="101.3" y="337.9" text-anchor="start">La Union</text>
      </g>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>9 communities we proudly serve</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="chips reveal" style="margin-top:34px;">
      <span class="chip">Chaparral, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">La Mesa, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">Anthony, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">Berino, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">Mesquite, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">Vado, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">Chamberino, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">La Union, NM</span>
      <span class="chip">San Miguel, NM</span>
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);">
      Not sure if we reach your neighborhood? <a href="/contact">Ask us</a> or call
      <a href="tel:+15758240887">(575)&nbsp;824-0887</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ TESTIMONIALS ============ -->
<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">What locals say</span>
      <h2>Trusted by homeowners & businesses</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="quote-card reveal">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"Never miss a pickup and always friendly on the phone. It's great to work with a company that actually knows the neighborhood."</p>
        <div class="who"><div class="avatar">RM</div><div><b>Rosa M.</b><small>Chaparral, NM</small></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote-card reveal">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"We rent dumpsters for our job sites and Chaparral Disposal is always on time and fairly priced. Highly recommend."</p>
        <div class="who"><div class="avatar">JT</div><div><b>James T.</b><small>Property Manager</small></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote-card reveal">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"Family owned and it shows. Prompt service and honest pricing — exactly what you want from your trash company."</p>
        <div class="who"><div class="avatar">DL</div><div><b>Diana L.</b><small>Anthony, NM</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2>Ready for reliable waste service?</h2>
      <p>Get a free, no-pressure quote today. Home or business, we'll find the right plan for you.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--white btn--lg" href="tel:+15758240887">Call (575) 824-0887</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
